  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There are a lot of weird issues with lag now in the UI. In some cases, clicking buttons in the UI will take a while to actually open the window that's expected. It will also not function properly when trying to select users by clicking on them or using the arrows. What appears to happen is it keeps toggling to another random person that you didn't mean to select seconds after the one you actually wanted is chosen. This happens on the current version of VRChat and I tested it on PC for the Steam version. Usually happens in worlds with fair amounts of people like Murder 2.",
